{
  "id": "28",
  "title": "HTMX + Prism",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.12) 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B82F6\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon redefines the <strong>Hypermedia Driven Architecture (HDA)</strong>. By merging <strong>HTMX</strong> with the <strong>Prism</strong> engine, you achieve high-fidelity interactivity using pure server-rendered fragments.</p></div><h2>The HDA Evolution</h2><p>Traditional SPAs suffer from state synchronization debt. Photon's HTMX stack eliminates this by keeping the source of truth on the server while delivering lightning-fast DOM deltas directly to the browser.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(59,130,246,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">UNIFIED LOGIC</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Validation, authorization, and business logic stay where they belong: on the server. Zero client-side duplication.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(59,130,246,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z\"/><path d=\"M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">SSR FRAGMENTS</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Prism's micro-caching allows rendering partial fragments in under 1ms, resulting in instant UI responsiveness.</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(59,130,246,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 4 23 10 17 10\"/><path d=\"M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">AUTO-ORCHESTRA</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">The <code>htmxMiddleware</code> automatically handles request detection and swaps, reducing boilerplate by 70%.</p></div></div><h2>Orchestration Protocol</h2><p>Detection is handled at the engine level. By checking the <code>HX-Request</code> header, Photon decides whether to render a full layout or a targeted atomic fragment.</p><pre><code>import { Photon, htmxMiddleware } from '@gravito/photon'\n\nconst app = new Photon()\napp.use(htmxMiddleware())\n\napp.get('/search', async (c) => {\n  const query = c.req.query('q')\n  const view = c.get('view')\n  \n  const results = await db.search(query)\n\n  // Atomic Swap Detection\n  if (c.get('htmx')) {\n    return c.html(view.render('partials/results', { results }))\n  }\n  \n  return c.html(view.render('pages/search', { results }))\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #3B82F6; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// SYSTEM_LOG: HYPERMEDIA_STRATEGY</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">Using <strong>Hx-Push-Url</strong>, Photon updates the browser history even when rendering fragments, ensuring that the back button and deep linking work exactly like a traditional SPA but with 90% less JavaScript.</p></div><h2>Performance Delta</h2><p>Data visualization of the payload efficiency between standard JSON hydration and Photon's HDA fragments.</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #3B82F6; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_HDA_FRAGMENT</span> <span>1.2KB</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 15%; background: #3B82F6; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(59,130,246,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>CLIENT_SIDE_HYDRATION (BUNDLE + JSON)</span> <span>145.8KB</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// MASSIVE REDUCTION IN INITIAL JS EXECUTION THREAD BLOCKING</p></div><h2>Prism Partial Patterns</h2><p>Leverage the <code>@include</code> and <code>@component</code> directives in Prism to create reusable UI fragments.</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">Search Trigger</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>&lt;input type=\"text\"\n       name=\"q\"\n       hx-get=\"/search\"\n       hx-trigger=\"keyup delay:500ms\"\n       hx-target=\"#results\"\n       hx-indicator=\".spinner\" /&gt;</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">The Result Fragment</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:11px;\"><code>@each results as item\n  &lt;div class=\"card shadow-sm\"&gt;\n    &lt;h3&gt;{{ item.title }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n    &lt;button hx-delete=\"/post/{{item.id}}\"&gt;\n      Delete\n    &lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n@endeach</code></pre></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(0, 184, 148, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #00b894; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Use <code>hx-boost=\"true\"</code> on your parent container to automatically convert all standard anchors and forms into AJAX requests, instantly transforming your site into a SPA without writing a single line of JavaScript.</p></div>",
